{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "9b06ad93400b8090630c9bb7d6b1937603d4db72f0b69454709381fac91a4ef3", "ja": "雑誌の撮影前", "zh": "杂志拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6000_place", "source_sha256": "d4791fb11477fe30ba4df1a8faada2b28b2b8855f65e1a06166ed650c671fc94", "ja": "公園", "zh": "公园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6001_p", "source_sha256": "7fac6772abc3264628f0feefe307bcfd687fb13913ae62f1f254a343940a53b0", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\nロコが犬たちと戯れる様子を撮る予定だ）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n预定拍摄ROCO和狗狗们嬉戏的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6002_025roc", "source_sha256": "3564d7e5586ef82d97c84e5b02d3e6ae2130611f09358d8a3b5d325be32a0186", "ja": "とってもイノベーティブなコスチュームですね！\nどんなフォトグラフになるか、楽しみです♪", "zh": "真是非常有创意的服装呢！\n真期待会拍出什么样的照片♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6003_p", "source_sha256": "6afb0b689e3b33504e56d893a9f29260df4af9ce0aab3093679ef6e65b46ec71", "ja": "そうだな。共演する犬たちも人に慣れてるみたいだし、\nいい写真になりそうだな！", "zh": "是啊。一起出演的狗狗们好像也很亲人，应该能拍出很棒的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6004_025roc", "source_sha256": "ef090b6181b01ce3e180e995406538bfdf3edc79aa6a8ee2ec14cc7b64299a64", "ja": "はい。えっと……ドッグのコスチュームを\nロコがプロデュースできると聞いたんですが……。", "zh": "好的。那个……我听说可以由ROCO负责设计狗狗的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6005_p", "source_sha256": "bd596f9321e22105326fec6c712e7b9931fce462ef3bb4851aa5ed81709d4674", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。犬用の服やアクセサリーを\nたくさん用意してくれたみたいだ。", "zh": "啊，是的。听说罗可可以负责设计狗狗的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6006_025roc", "source_sha256": "12ef5a791ecc688c9c2c727594c03dce5fe9b8be992a80467d182652b5637db9", "ja": "サンクスです！　スタッフのグッドなお仕事には、\nパーフェクトなプロデュースで返さないとですね！", "zh": "谢谢啦！　对于工作人员出色的工作，\n可得用完美的制作来回报才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6007_025roc", "source_sha256": "dbedd536e161f822c443501f7efa5a430a1d0511ddc6bd86f30c08d02817e488", "ja": "ドッグたちが、もっとチャーミングに見えるものを\nチョイスして……ぶつぶつぶつ。", "zh": "挑选一些能让狗狗们看起来更迷人的东西……嘟嘟囔囔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6008_null", "source_sha256": "26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633", "ja": "30分後……", "zh": "30分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6009_025roc", "source_sha256": "5f13d663b96f8af974e6202b61ce52884b2a5338a2284fbf1f451a76c58dc034", "ja": "ううっ。こんなにあると一つに決められません……。\n{$P$}、ヘルプです～！", "zh": "呜呜。有这么多的话，根本选不出一个来嘛……\n{$P$}，快帮帮伴田～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6010_p", "source_sha256": "dc51da19cd0eaff6124cc53cf5706f2358a8d49ee6d049884b6de2905e6c145e", "ja": "これが終わらないと、撮影が始められないな……。\nよし。まずテーマを決めてみよう！　たとえば……。", "zh": "在这结束之前，没法开始拍摄啊……\n好，那就先决定主题吧！比如……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6011", "source_sha256": "3e239aa182b03a9d1c043cf02d55dfa01de91ee8d9fee5bdb35c8393a2206ba1", "ja": "キュートに！", "zh": "变得可爱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6012", "source_sha256": "a9dd7101b3b1c27010117396d0334cb88c7e432f925cd77b6089e6c5c203e433", "ja": "ワイルドに！", "zh": "野性狂野！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6013", "source_sha256": "f872d342c04b28a4f1368a0586f877c9a36de799a2b42f697c25b26f4777c994", "ja": "トレンディに！", "zh": "走在潮流前沿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6100_p", "source_sha256": "58447d6c7d3384710fb85c26b867cc48d7d2e228c61f7e4e53689f5ba5d67098", "ja": "犬たちが、もっとかわいく見えるような……\n『キュート』をテーマにするのはどうだ？", "zh": "让狗狗们看起来更加可爱一些……以“可爱”为主题怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6101_025roc", "source_sha256": "62629e2bb77259133d81fd84e036e49800f0a8e5037d629b1d7575d8b5748549", "ja": "キュート……。ロコのプロデュースで、もっともっと\nキュートなドッグに！　……ナイスアイディアです♪", "zh": "可爱……在ROCO的制作下，变成更加更加可爱的狗狗！……真是个好主意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6102_025roc", "source_sha256": "98027b9da09e9760c915a93df0cd73b7067def8e4b4045903ab57a569129a5ce", "ja": "それなら、レースのリボンをプラスして……。ロコの\nイマジネーションがエクスプロージョンしてきました！", "zh": "那就再加上蕾丝缎带……ROCO的想象力开始爆发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6200_p", "source_sha256": "ae17f7f3ea757d8f4843b6eb4a72f4d96d9f1505819b5238a377e836cde09152", "ja": "犬たちのかっこいい魅力を見せるとか。\n『ワイルド』がテーマじゃダメかな？", "zh": "比如展现狗狗们帅气的一面。\n以“狂野”为主题不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6201_025roc", "source_sha256": "ef3c1ebaa523a928f66817ae268f2690715e13dc9ce7e6b5a4be8aceeb5a6731", "ja": "なるほど。インタレスティングなテーマですけど、\nロコズセンスが試されそうなテーマです……。", "zh": "原来如此。虽然是个有趣的主题，但似乎会考验ROCO的品味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6202_025roc", "source_sha256": "76ba189830f0f4719d07364a0b2fb6fcc425c37e55faf66a0321769371212bee", "ja": "でも、ギブアップしませんよ！　ロコがきっと、\nワイルドなドッグにカスタムしてみせます！", "zh": "不过，我不会认输的！ROCO一定会把它定制成一只狂野的狗狗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6300_p", "source_sha256": "f7a5a8b1c626b84c9bf9fd213e7003c94ed6874e69be7676fe43a6950e47d09e", "ja": "犬のファッションにも流行があると思うから、\n最近のトレンドをテーマにしてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "我觉得狗狗的时尚也有流行趋势，不如试着以最近的潮流为主题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6301_025roc", "source_sha256": "614d8147416aa2e3fde76f9d5099aea145f6ff709f5d442749a78603c5539f2c", "ja": "ふむふむ。ナイスなアイディアですけど、\nドッグのトレンドは、リサーチしてませんでした……。", "zh": "嗯嗯。虽然是个不错的主意，不过我还没研究过狗狗的流行趋势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6302_025roc", "source_sha256": "c962a4fbf9970a3456c4472a9421385e5355825bfa7ced9199e462ef36ff1f25", "ja": "ソーリーです、{$P$}！\nロコ、ドッグのトレンドをリサーチしてきますね！", "zh": "抱歉啦，{$P$}！\nROCO，我这就去调查狗狗的潮流趋势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_6303_p", "source_sha256": "854065c1e3d8bc47e151805b8a4e9df06f9d4f0c068efbd2ede9269ed2a60287", "ja": "えっ、今からか！？\nちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ！　ロコ、戻ってこーい！", "zh": "诶，现在就去吗！？\n等、等一下！ROCO，快回来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
